---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Who writes AIStackHub and how we test the tools we review."
>
  <div class="wrap section-head prose" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1>About AIStackHub</h1>
    <p>
      AIStackHub reviews AI tools for students, developers, and freelancers. Replace this
      paragraph with a real bio: who you are, why you started this, and what makes your
      reviews trustworthy (e.g. "I'm an IT student who tests every tool on my own coursework
      and freelance projects before writing about it").
    </p>
    <p>
      Every review is based on hands-on use, not press releases. When we're not sure about
      something, we say so instead of guessing.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
